        "original_id": "95d7791b-0a17-5f86-b95f-7ed196de84e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Radomski, Bruce Timm, Isaac C. Singleton Jr.\n- TV series: Avengers Assemble, Ultimate Spider-Man, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., Guardians of the Galaxy\n- Films: Batman: Mask of the Phantasm, The Avengers\n- Video games: Lego Marvel's Avengers\n- Characters: Thanos\n- Networks: Disney XD\n\nFacts:\n- Batman: Mask of the Phantasm was directed by Eric Radomski and Bruce Timm and is a cinematic continuation of Batman: The Animated Series.\n- Avengers Assemble was designed to capitalize on the success of the 2012 film The Avengers.\n- Avengers Assemble premiered on Disney XD on May 26, 2013, as the successor to The Avengers: Earth's Mightiest Heroes.\n- Eric Radomski worked on Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., and Guardians of the Galaxy.\n- Isaac C. Singleton Jr. voiced Thanos in the television series Guardians of the Galaxy and Avengers Assemble and in the video game Lego Marvel's Avengers.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
